  "description": "Web chat widget: POST /webhook/widget/<account>/{session|send|poll}. widget_gate rejects malformed input (400) and requests over the per-IP / per-visitor limits (429) before anything else runs. A visitor session is an HMAC-signed token (Crypto node, secret in credentials). Caddy limits the body size and answers CORS for WIDGET_ORIGINS."
